      50.88,
      435.19,
      286.67,
      507.41
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      508.87,
      286.71,
      597.43
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: Two allotments of land shown as lot 1 & 2 in Preliminary Plan No. Ma/1629, prepared by Surveyor General, situated at Udawaradamana Village in Gampahasiya pattuwa minor Division of Matale Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Matale District, Central province. And bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      599.55,
      286.69,
      648.36
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1 \u2014 Name of the Land: Hapugahalanda-watta; Original ownership: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.3591 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      13.918607711791992
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      649.8,
      289.32,
      705.43
    ],
    "text": "North: Hapugahalandawatta claimed by S. Sotthilingam; East: Hapugahalandawatta climed by T. G. Karunarathna and others; South: Road; West: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.16,
      539.66,
      379.56
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 2 \u2014 Name of the Land: Hapugahalanda-watta; Original ownership: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.8561 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      381.0,
      539.64,
      448.16
    ],
    "text": "North: Road (Pradeshiya sabha) and Road; East: Hapugahalandawatta climed by Land Reform Commission and Road; South: Hapugahalandawatta claimed by Land Reform Commission; West: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      450.05,
      539.67,
      638.22
    ],
    "text": "All person interested in the aforesaid Land on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Matale Divisional Secretariat on the 26th day of February, 2016 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 19th day of February, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. K. P. K. L. P. MADHUWANTHI, Divisional Secretary, Matale.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
